      "content": "i get that, but like, i know exactly how much i need to take cuz i have the bottle right here. if i just take a standard dose of like 500mg to see if it helps, is there really any harm in that? it's just one dose to test it out, it's not like i'm starting a whole new regimen or anything. it would save me so much time.",
